  ingestr version v1.1.61
  -rwxrwxr-x 1 ubuntu ubuntu 254172496 Oct  3 15:38 /home/ubuntu/.cache/ingestr/bin/v1.1.61/Linux_x86_64/ingestr
  ingestr 1.1.x is no longer a Python program: the pip package is a thin
  wrapper that downloads and execs this 254 MB native binary, which is
  mounted read-only, so nothing is downloaded inside a measurement.

